                                                "sense_id": "e907c334-71c6-3817-a485-0d0ac891698d",
                                                "text": "There were other disputes in Scotland, indeed in Glasgow, some affecting local authority services, and from the second day of coverage of the dustcart strike, reporting often linked them in bulletins; […]"
